Source: BodyParts3D version 3.0 (2011-09-15), polygon data for the parts
listed in scripts/brain-mesh/part_ids.txt (cortical gyri, cerebellum,
pons, medulla oblongata, midbrain), obtained through the STL mirror at
https://github.com/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/BodyParts3D.

Changes: the parts were merged into one mesh, decimated from about 1.3
million to 45,000 triangles, centred, and scaled so the longest axis is
2 units. scripts/brain-mesh/build.py reproduces the file.

